	(text "12v permanent live from vehicle\n12v permanent live with reverse polarity protection\n12v permanent live after the voltage reading circuitry\n12v ignition signal (high when ignition on)\n12v ignition signal with reverse polarity protection\nVehicle chassis ground\nSystem ground\n3.3v supply from the MCU\nIgnition sense signal (LOW if ignition on)\nRelay SET (always on), pulse 3.3v for 350ms\nRelay RST (ignition on), pulse 3.3v for 350ms\nHIGH when always-on, RLY_RST_FB will be LOW\nLOW when ignition-on, RLY_SET_FB will be HIGH\n12v from the relay, either 12v permanent live or the ignition rail\n12v from the relay with reverse polarity protection\n5v supply from the buck converter to the MCU"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
